88. barag-barag-ge ŋiri₃ sa-ga i₃-mi-dug₄#
#tr.en: Go now in peace to your master @wDN{Ašimbabbar}.”}
#lem: barag[sanctum]; ŋiri[foot]; saga[press?]; dug[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=88

89. mu-zu zag an-na-še₃ mu-u₃-ŋar
#tr.en: And so he moored the boat at @wSN{Enegir},
#lem: mu[name]; zag[side]; an[sky]; ŋar[put]
#etcsl: line-id=89

