91. enegir₃{ki} iri me-lem₄-ma du₃-a
#tr.en: (@wRN{Šulgi} speaks:) @q[Culgi,Ninazu]{“Seed placed by the prince in the holy womb,
#lem: Enegir[1]SN; iri[city]; melim[frightening splendor]; du[build]
